=2 Walkthrough
* As a Red Mage, Talk to {p:Curilla} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} at (I-9) to start this quest.
** Note: You don't have to be RDM for the remainder of this quest.
* Head to {z:Southern San d'Oria}, find {n:Sharzalion} at (K-6) in the Lion Springs Tavern and speak to him.
* Kill {m:Miser Murphy} in {z:Fei'Yin} for an {i:Antique Coin|Antique Coin|1093}.
** He will pop at (H-8) on map1 if the quest is active.
** 10 minute respawn time

!Fei'Yin-map1.jpg||Fei'Yin map 1
* Trade the coin to the **Dry Fountain** at (H-8) for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Southern San d'Oria} and speak to {n:Sharzalion} and then speak with {n:Daggao} who is in the bar as well.
** {p:Curilla} has additional optional dialogue.
* Go to {z:Garlaige Citadel} (G-8) behind the first banishing gate (map 2) click the Oaken Box in the first room to the left. This will spawn the {m:Guardian Statue}.
** If you get the message "Something feels wrong, but nothing happens.", click off Sneak.

!Garlaige Citadel-map2.jpg||Garlaige Citadel map 2
* Kill him for a {i:Nail Puller|Nail Puller|1094}.
* Trade the Nail Puller to the same Oaken box for a Cutscene.
* Zone into {z:Northern San d'Oria} for a Cutscene and {i:Warlock's Chapeau|Warlock's Chapeau|12513}.

